itle":"晚步","author":"张嵲","text":"晚来聊复岸乌纱，指点园林已罢花。\n高柳交阴斜日照，閒携儿稚看栖鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56494,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚秋风雨","author":"张嵲","text":"满目萧萧云气流，芭蕉梧叶共飕飗。\n松门尽日无来客，独与疏篁傲晚秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56495,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登石门山山侧有观基在荒筠中不可到山相对即新安县也今谓之新安平二首 其二","author":"张嵲","text":"石门山对新安县，基址平来蔓草秋。\n千尺微江清见底，悲鸣还向县前流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56496,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚望西崖","author":"张嵲","text":"西崖佳树绿层层，日落山烟满树生。\n萧然倚杖疏篱外，遥听幽泉断续鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56497,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚晴","author":"张嵲","text":"前山收苦雾，宿鸟有新声。\n万里南天客，三冬此日晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56498,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚晴","author":"张嵲","text":"繁香苦爱飘岐路，风雨何须送晚春。\n坐久绮霞明落照，屏雷亦解慰游人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56499,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅","author":"张嵲","text":"一枝寒艳映窗光，蕊气侵衣断客肠。\n汉上水边千万树，春来何地着清香。","